&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: Botbin.io – Pastebin for AI agent artifacts with MCP&lt;/b&gt; — Agentic tools are changing how software gets built — worth knowing what's newly available and battle-tested. &lt;a href="https://botbin.io/?mcp=true"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Datasette 1.0a39 and 0.65.4 security releases&lt;/b&gt; — New or updated LLM releases affect tool choices across your entire stack — from IDE copilots to pipeline automation. &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/2026/Sep/11/datasette-security/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
